    </div>
    </li> <heading id="h-0005">Density:</heading>
    <li> <para-num num="[0059]"> </para-num> <div id="p-0063" num="0059" class="description-line">The density (δSep) was determined in accordance with DIN 53 479, method A.</div>
    </li> <li> <div id="p-0064" num="0000" class="description-line">Porosity: As porosity, the free volume in the separator film for access of the electrolyte was calculated in % as follows:</div>
    </li> <li> <div id="p-0065" num="0000" class="description-line">
      <maths id="MATH-US-00002" num="00002">
        <math overflow="scroll">
          <mrow>
            <mrow>
              <mi>Porosity</mi>
              <mo></mo>
