  <section itemprop="claims" itemscope>
    <h2>Claims (<span itemprop="count">29</span>)</h2>
    
    <div itemprop="content" html><div mxw-id="PCLM86828595" lang="EN" load-source="patent-office" class="claims">
    <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-01-27" num="01-27" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>1</b>.-<b>27</b>. (canceled)</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00028" num="00028" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>28</b>. A biaxially oriented single-layer or multilayer porous film, which comprises at least one porous layer and this layer contains at least one propylene polymer,
<div class="claim-text">(i) the porosity of the porous film is 30% to 80%,</div> <div class="claim-text">(ii) the permeability of the porous film is ≦800 s (Gurley value),</div> <div class="claim-text">(iii) has an elastic modulus in the longitudinal direction of ≧300 N/mm<sup>2</sup>,</div> <div class="claim-text">(iv) an elastic modulus in the transverse direction of ≧300 N/mm<sup>2</sup>,</div> <div class="claim-text">(v) a density of at least 0.35 g/cm<sup>3</sup>,</div> <div class="claim-text">(vi) a resistance to puncturing of at least 0.3 N/μm and</div> <div class="claim-text">(vii) a thickness from 10 to 150 μm.</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00029" num="00029" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>29</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the porosity is produced by conversion of β-crystalline polypropylene as the film is drawn, wherein at least one β-nucleation agent is present in the film.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00030" num="00030" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>30</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the propylene polymer is a propylene homopolymer and/or a propylene block copolymer.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00031" num="00031" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>31</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00029">claim 29</claim-ref>, wherein the β-nucleation agent is a calcium salt of pimelic acid and/or suberic acid and/or a nanoscale iron oxide.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00032" num="00032" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>32</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the film contains propylene homopolymer and propylene block copolymer.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00033" num="00033" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>33</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00029">claim 29</claim-ref>, wherein the film contains 50 to 85% by weight of propylene homopolymer, 15 to 50% by weight of propylene block copolymer, and 50 to 10,000 ppm of β-nucleation agent.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00034" num="00034" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>34</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the density of the film lies in a range 0.35 to 0.6 g/cm<sup>3</sup>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00035" num="00035" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>35</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the film has a thickness from 15 to 100 μm.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00036" num="00036" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>36</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the propylene polymer was not produced by use of metallocene catalyst.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00037" num="00037" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>37</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the permability of the porous film is 20 to ≦800 s (Gurley value).</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00038" num="00038" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>38</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the elastic modulus of the film in the longitudinal direction is 300 to 3500 N/mm<sup>2</sup>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00039" num="00039" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>39</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the elastic modulus of the film in the transverse direction is 400 to 3000 N/mm<sup>2</sup>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00040" num="00040" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>40</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the shrinkage in the longitudinal direction at 100° C. and 1 hour is ≦10%</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00041" num="00041" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>41</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the shrinkage in the transverse direction at 100° C. and 1 hour is ≦10%.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00042" num="00042" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>42</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>, wherein the resistance to puncturing of the film according to the invention is at least 0.35 N per μm film thickness.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00043" num="00043" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>43</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00029">claim 29</claim-ref>, wherein the film is obtainable by a method comprising the following steps:
<div class="claim-text">(i) extruding a single-layer or multilayer porous polypropylene film in which propylene polymer and β-nucleation agent are melted in an extruder and are extruded through a flat film die onto a take-off roll,</div> <div class="claim-text">(ii) cooling and solidifying the extruded melt film, thus forming β-crystallites,</div> <div class="claim-text">(iii) drawing the film in the longitudinal direction and then in the transverse direction, and</div> <div class="claim-text">(iv) performing a thermal treatment (thermofixing) in which the product of temperature during the thermofixing in degrees Celsius (T<sub>F</sub>) and duration of the thermofixing in seconds (t<sub>F</sub>) is at least 3000° Cs (T<sub>F</sub>×t<sub>F</sub>≧3000° Cs).</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00044" num="00044" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>44</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00043">claim 43</claim-ref>, wherein the maximum temperature during the thermofixing (T<sub>F</sub>) is ≦160° C.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00045" num="00045" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>45</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00043">claim 43</claim-ref>, wherein the thermal treatment (thermofixing) of the film at least comprises a period of ≧20 s and a temperature in the range from 100 to 150° C.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00046" num="00046" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>46</b>. The film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00043">claim 43</claim-ref>, wherein the temperature in the thermofixing (T<sub>F</sub>) is greater than the temperature in the transverse drawing (T<sub>Q</sub>) and the temperature in the transverse drawing (T<sub>Q</sub>) is in turn greater than the temperature in the longitudinal drawing (T<sub>L</sub>).</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00047" num="00047" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>47</b>. A method for producing the film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00029">claim 29</claim-ref>, comprising the following steps:
<div class="claim-text">(i) extruding a single-layer or multilayer porous polypropylene film in which propylene polymer and β-nucleation agent are melted in an extruder and are extruded through a flat film die onto a take-off roll,</div> <div class="claim-text">(ii) cooling and solidifying the extruded melt film, thus forming β-crystallites,</div> <div class="claim-text">(iii) drawing the film in the longitudinal direction and then in the transverse direction, and</div> <div class="claim-text">(iv) performing a thermal treatment (thermofixing), in which the product of temperature during the thermofixing in degrees Celsius (T<sub>F</sub>) and duration of the thermofixing in seconds (t<sub>F</sub>) is at least 3000° Cs (T<sub>F</sub>×t<sub>F</sub>≧3000° Cs).</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00048" num="00048" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>48</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00047">claim 47</claim-ref>, wherein measures (i) to (iii) and the thermal treatment (thermofixing) according to (iv) are performed in two separate method steps.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00049" num="00049" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>49</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00047">claim 47</claim-ref>, wherein the maximum temperature during the thermofixing (T<sub>F</sub>) is ≦160° C.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00050" num="00050" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>50</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00047">claim 47</claim-ref>, wherein the thermal treatment (thermofixing) of the film at least comprises a period of ≧20 s and a temperature in the range of 100 to 150° C.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00051" num="00051" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>51</b>. A separator in high-energy or high-performance systems which comprises the film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00052" num="00052" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>52</b>. A high-energy or high-performance system comprising the film according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00028">claim 28</claim-ref>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00053" num="00053" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>53</b>. A biaxially oriented single-layer or multilayer porous film, which comprises at least one porous layer and this layer contains at least one propylene polymer,
<div class="claim-text">(i) the porosity of the porous film is 30% to 80% and</div> <div class="claim-text">(ii) the permeability of the porous film is ≦800 s (Gurley value), and</div> <div class="claim-text">(iii) has an elastic modulus in the longitudinal direction of ≧300 N/mm<sup>2 </sup>and</div> <div class="claim-text">(iv) an elastic modulus in the transverse direction of ≧300 N/mm<sup>2 </sup>and</div> <div class="claim-text">(v) a density of at least 0.35 g/cm<sup>3 </sup>and</div> <div class="claim-text">(vi) a dynamic resistance to penetration of at least 0.25 N/μm or a transverse shrinkage &lt;2% and</div> <div class="claim-text">(vii) a thickness from 10 to 150 μm.</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00054" num="00054" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>54</b>. The biaxially oriented single-layer or multilayer porous film as claimed in <claim-ref idref="CLM-00053">claim 53</claim-ref>, which comprises at least one porous layer and this layer contains at least one propylene polymer,
<div class="claim-text">(i) the porosity of the porous film is 30% to 80% and</div> <div class="claim-text">(ii) the permeability of the porous film is ≦800 s (Gurley value), and</div> <div class="claim-text">(iii) has an elastic modulus in the longitudinal direction of ≧300 N/mm<sup>2 </sup>and</div> <div class="claim-text">(iv) an elastic modulus in the transverse direction of ≧300 N/mm<sup>2 </sup>and</div> <div class="claim-text">(v) a density of at least 0.35 g/cm<sup>3 </sup>and</div> <div class="claim-text">(vi) a dynamic resistance to penetration of at least 0.25 N/μm, and</div> <div class="claim-text">(vii) a thickness from 10 to 150 μm.</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00055" num="00055" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>55</b>. A biaxially oriented single-layer or multilayer porous film, which comprises at least one porous layer and this layer contains at least one propylene polymer,
<div class="claim-text">(i) the porosity of the porous film is 30% to 80% and</div> <div class="claim-text">(ii) the permeability of the porous film is ≦800 s (Gurley value), and</div> <div class="claim-text">(iv) has a density of at least 0.35 g/cm<sup>3 </sup>and</div> <div class="claim-text">(v) a static resistance to puncturing of at least 0.3 N/μm, and</div> <div class="claim-text">(vi) a thickness from 10 to 150 μm.</div> </div>
    </div>
  </div> </div>
  </div>
